{"sourceUrl":"https://sipa.jlu.edu.cn/info/1044/8561.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:05.061902+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sipa.jlu.edu.cn/info/1044/8561.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>为确保我院</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年接收推荐免试攻读研究生（以下简称</span><span>“推免生”）的复试录取工作规范有序，结合实际，制定本办法。 </span></span></p>\n<h1><span><span>一</span></span><span><span>、推免硕士生</span></span><span><span>招生专业</span></span></h1>\n<p><span><span>外交学（</span><span>030208）</span></span></p>\n<h1><span><span>二、</span></span><span><span>报考</span></span><span><span>要求</span></span></h1>\n<p><span><span>（一）报名条件</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，具有正确的政治方向，热爱祖国，愿意为社会主义现代化建设服务，遵纪守法，品行端正。</span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>具有所在学校推免生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生。</span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较好的专业素养，有较强的创新意识和创新能力，有较高的培养潜质。</span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>身体和心理状况符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）报名方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>考生登录学校推免生预报名系统</span><span>yzb.jlu.edu.cn进行报名，报名截止时间为2025年9月21日下午16:00。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）</span></span><span><span>提交材料</span></span><span><span>清单</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>《</span></span><span><span>吉林大学</span> </span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年推免生预报名表</span> </span><span><span>》</span></span><span><span>扫描件（预报名系统内导出）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>《吉林大学</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年接收推荐免试研究生申请表》</span></span><span><span>扫描件</span></span><span><span>（见附件</span></span><span><span>，打印并手写签字盖章后扫描</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.申请人</span></span><span><span>有效第二代居民身份证</span></span><span><span>扫描件</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>正反面在同一页</span></span><span><span>）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>申请人学生证扫描件（包含个人照片页、学校盖章的信息页及注册页，需要每学期均加盖注册章，合并在同一页）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span>加盖所在学校教务部门公章的本科期间</span></span><span><span>成绩单扫描件（原件扫描）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>.在校期间发表的论文、获得专利的证书、研究成果证明、获奖证书、外语水平考试证书等材料</span></span><span><span>扫描件</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>原件扫描</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（四）材料提交方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>上述材料按照序号</span><span>1-6顺序扫描至1个PDF文档中，于2025年9月21日下午16:00前发送至指定电子邮箱。</span></span><span><span>邮件标题及文档以</span><span>“本科院校+姓名+报名专业+2026年推免”命名。逾期未提交材料视为放弃报名资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>为方便沟通，请申请人加入</span><span>QQ群“吉林大学公共外交学院2026年推免联络群”（825085273），入群验证信息：本科院校+姓名，加入后请按此格式修改群内备注名。</span></span></p>\n<h1><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>、资格审查</span></span></h1>\n<p><span><span>参加复试的考生必须符合吉林大学</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年接收免试生条件，资格审查不合格者取消复试和录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<h1><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>、复试方式和内容</span> </span></h1>\n<p><span><span>1.复试方式及要求</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>采用网络远程复试方式。考生要准备的设备、网络条件、考生考试环境要求等请参考《</span></span><span><span>公共外交学院</span></span><span><span>研究生网络远程考试考生须知》</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>见附件</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2．复试主要内容</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1）专业素质和能力</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>包括：大学阶段学习情况及成绩；全面考核考生对本学科（类别）、专业（领域）理论知识和应用技能掌握程度，利用所学理论发现、分析和解决问题的能力，对本学科（类别）发展动态的了解以及在本专业（领域）发展的能力；创新精神和创新能力。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2）综合素质和能力</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>包括：思想政治素质和品德考核，内容包含推免生的政治态度、思想表现、道德品质、遵纪守法、诚实守信等方面；本学科（类别）专业（领域）以外的学习、科研、社会实践（学生工作、社团活动、志愿者服务等）或实际工作表现等方面的情况；事业心、责任感、纪律性（遵纪守法）、协作性；人文素养；心理健康情况。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>3）外语听说能力测试</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>包括：外语听、说等综合能力考察。</span></span></p>\n<h1><span><span>五</span></span><span><span>、复试成绩及录取</span></span></h1>\n<p><span><span>1.复试成绩满分300分，最后折合成100分，保留小数点后两位。复试中总分、专业素质和能力、综合素质和能力、外语听说能力测试任一项未达到及格线的考生不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<div>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>复试科目</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>分</span>  <span>数</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>及格线</span></span></strong></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>专业素质和能力</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>150分</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>90分</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>综合素质和能力</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>100分</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>60分</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>外语听说能力测试</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>50分</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>30分</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>合</span>  <span>计</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>300分</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>180分</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p><span><span>2.思想政治素质和道德品质考核不合格者不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.参加我院“2025年校园学术</span></span><span><span>活动</span></span><span><span>开放日</span><span>”并考核合格的同学，取得</span></span><span><span>本科</span></span><span><span>学校</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>推荐免试资格</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>者</span></span><span><span>，在符合我校接收推荐免试硕士研究生相关要求和学院相关政策基础上，按要求报名并提交材料，通过我院资格审核后，</span></span><span><span>可不</span></span><span><span>参加复试，</span></span><span><span>按照</span></span><span><span>开放日</span></span><span><span>考核成绩排名由高到低进行第一批次录取</span></span><span><span>。报考志愿须与</span></span><span><span>开放日</span></span><span><span>专业</span></span><span><span>志愿</span></span><span><span>一致，未按时报名并提交相关材料，视为放弃资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>开放日考核合格学员</span></span><span><span>录取完毕后如仍有剩余</span></span><span><span>招生</span></span><span><span>名额，将组织复试，按复试成绩</span></span><span><span>由高到低</span></span><span><span>依次排序，进行第二批次录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.拟录取考生，须根据我院安排，在规定时间内通过“全国推荐免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”完成“待录取确认”</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>否则视为放弃资格</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<h1><span><span>六</span></span><span><span>、时间安排</span></span></h1>\n<p><span><span>具体复试时间另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>我院将结合实际，通知拟录取考生完成系统志愿填报，并陆续进行</span><span>“参加复试”和“确认录取”的推送，请务必及时点击确认，逾期未完成最终录取确认者，视为放弃。</span></span></p>\n<h1><span><span>七</span></span><span><span>、信息公开</span></span></h1>\n<p><span><span>拟录取名单确定后，我院将在官网进行公示。拟录取考生须随时关注报名系统和短信提醒，随时关注</span><span>QQ群相关通知。</span></span></p>\n<h1><span><span>如有放弃录取、自行更改志愿或已被其他院校录取等情况，须马上致电我院告知，否则产生录取异常等后果</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>由考生自行承担。</span></span></h1>\n<h1><span><span>八、联系方式</span></span></h1>\n<p><span><span>联系人：王老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>电</span> <span>话：</span><span>0431-85167204  13596195065</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>电子邮箱：</span></span><a href=\"mailto:sipayjs@jlu.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>sipayjs@jlu.edu.cn</span></span></a></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>未尽事宜，按照学校相关规定执行。</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>附件：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>吉林大学</span><span>2026年接收推荐免试研究生申请表</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.吉林大学公共外交学院研究生网络远程复试考生须知</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span></span></span><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>吉林大学</span></span><span><span>公共外交学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>                                <span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span><span><span>17</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"adea14b1c12d75921047aab403179400b4443edd490265086863706fd4f3db61","textLength":2006,"sourceSha256":"2702901f4b97c69c390644fca562235c4e4930c796c35b98333bfd7f44e6ca44","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"2.吉林大学公共外交学院研究生网络远程复试考生须知.pdf","url":"https://sipa.jlu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1550411868&wbfileid=16647206"},{"name":"1.吉林大学2026年接收推荐免试研究生申请表.docx","url":"https://sipa.jlu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1550411868&wbfileid=16647205"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-cdc98bfcb1cc120343bd","title":"2025年吉林大学公共外交学院2026年接收推荐免试攻读硕士研究生复试录取工作办法","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:05.061902+00:00"}
